 * Name: sunxi_itd_arm
 *
 * Description:
 *   (Re)program one ring iTD to receive up to ISOC_ITD_UFRAMES payloads,
 *   one per micro-frame.  Each transaction i reads into the iTD's own DMA
 *   buffer at offset i*maxpacket, so the payloads land in separate slots and
